---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Unusual Seeds — a quiet personal publication about science fiction, ecology, travel, technology, and the strange beauty of being alive."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-14">
    <p class="text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.18em] text-parchment-faint uppercase">
      About
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl">A place for ideas worth growing</h1>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-parchment-muted">
      <p>
        Unusual Seeds is a quiet personal publication about science fiction,
        ecology, travel, technology, and the strange beauty of being alive in a
        complicated world.
      </p>
      <p>
        It is built like a small garden: part notebook, part observatory, part
        collection of things worth returning to.
      </p>
      <p>
        The tone is curious, grounded, and cautiously hopeful. Not hype. Not
        doom. More like walking through a conservatory at blue hour and leaving
        with one better question than you arrived with.
      </p>
      <p>
        The garden holds five biomes. Seeds are essays and notes — planted over
        time in the archive.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-10">
      <a href="/" class="text-accent hover:text-parchment">Return home</a>
      <span class="mx-2 text-parchment-faint/50">·</span>
      <a href="/seeds" class="text-accent hover:text-parchment">Browse seeds</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
